 "_about": "Ember (Zeiger 0.42.0; Customise 0.45.0): a photo of an old BMW saloon at night in a field, its cabin lit red (cluster-design/ember/build.html). The car big in the lower middle; above it the speed with km/h and a hairline rev line, the selector letter, the gear and the drive mode on the left, range and the clock with the outside temperature on the right, warm white and a warm grey. Customise: the big readouts in one of four fonts (emberFont: barlow, clean, retro, motor), the M badge under the car (emberMid). The speed limit the front camera reads (Zeiger 0.50.0, {{speedLimit}}) in a small black and white round sign right of the speed, only while there is one. The rev line amber then the cabin red from the rev range (zoneSteps / zoneColors), faint ahead of the rpm. Barlow, Barlow Semi Condensed, Inter Tight, Jost and Saira Condensed (OFL). Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
